# ROADMAP — OODAC 9/10 Goal

File: openOODA/docs/ROADMAP.oot

OODAC 9/10 on safety, perf, security — best of rustc/Go/Zig plus OODAC's lattice (20+26 caps, typestate, SECRET, SMT, unique_fns, blackbox).

**Goal:** Safety 9, Perf 9, Security 9 — keep the lattice, steal the best.

**How:**
1. ty as enum (completeness 3→4)
2. borrowck &/&mut (safety)
3. clang -O2 + real llvm emit (perf)
4. net/http over TcpCap (security)

